ALLOWS FOR

00:02:15.270 --> 00:02:18.120
INVOLUNTARY SERVITUDE CONTINGENT
UPON

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:20.250
THE PASSAGE AND APPROVAL OF ACA
EIGHT.

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:22.830
AB 628 REQUIRES THE CALIFORNIA
DEPARTMENT

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:25.169
OF CORRECTIONS AND
REHABILITATION,

00:02:25.169 --> 00:02:27.150
ALSO KNOWN AS CDCR, TO CREATE

00:02:27.150 --> 00:02:28.800
A VOLUNTARY WORK PROGRAM.

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:30.990
FURTHER, IT CLARIFIES THAT CDCR

00:02:30.990 --> 00:02:32.190
AND LOCAL JURISDICTIONS

00:02:32.190 --> 00:02:34.080
SET COMPENSATION FOR
INCARCERATED

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:36.450
INDIVIDUALS IN STATE PRISON
FACILITIES

00:02:36.450 --> 00:02:38.610
AND LOCAL JAILS, RESPECTIVELY.

00:02:38.610 --> 00:02:41.430
IF ACA EIGHT IS APPROVED BY THE
VOTERS,

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:43.710
IT WILL END THE PRACTICE OF
INVOLUNTARY SERVITUDE,

00:02:43.710 --> 00:02:46.380
WHICH IS A RULE THAT HAVE
ALLOWED CALIFORNIA

00:02:46.380 --> 00:02:47.730
STATE PRISON TO USE FORCED

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:51.030
LABOR BY REMOVING THE LONG
STANDING EXCEPTION TO

00:02:51.030 --> 00:02:53.610
INVOLUNTARY SERVITUDE FOR
PUNISHMENT OF A CRIME,

00:02:53.610 --> 00:02:55.950
AND BY EXPLICITLY PROHIBITING
SLAVERY

00:02:55.950 --> 00:02:57.630
AND INVOLUNTARY SERVITUDE.

00:02:57.630 --> 00:03:00.000
IT WOULD FUNDAMENTALLY CHANGE
THE NATURE OF

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:02.700
WORK WITHIN OUR STATE'S CARCERAL
SYSTEM.

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:04.800
FOR THE FIRST TIME IN OUR STATE
HISTORY,

00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:08.100
THIS BILL WOULD REQUIRE THAT
WORK ASSIGNMENTS

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:10.590
FOR INCARCERATED INDIVIDUALS
IS VOLUNTARY,

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:12.900
AND THAT THEY WOULD NOT BE
SUBJECT TO DISCIPLINE

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:14.880
FOR REFUSING A WORK ASSIGNMENT,

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:16.560
ALLOWING FOR GREATER
PARTICIPATION

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:18.450
IN REHABILITATIVE SERVICES,

00:03:18.450 --> 00:03:20.850
AND HELPING TO RESTORE DIGNITY
AND BODILY

00:03:20.850 --> 00:03:23.280
AUTONOMY TO INCARCERATED
INDIVIDUALS.

00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:26.040
INCARCERATED PEOPLE HAVE LONG
FACED CRUEL

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:28.139
TREATMENT FOR ANY WORK ABSENCES.

00:03:28.139 --> 00:03:30.330
