VISITS,

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:34.980
AND LIMITING PARTICIPATION IN
REHABILITATIVE

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:36.450
PROGRAMS AND DISCIPLINARY

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:38.610
WRITE UPS THAT RESULT IN LONGER
PRISON TERMS.

